    "body": "<!--\n  Thank you for contributing to Neovim!\n  If this is your first time, check out https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#pull-requests-prs\n  for our PR guidelines.\n-->\n\n## Problem\nI have an app folder for all the TUI apps and noticed neovim wasn't in the group because it did not have `ConsoleOnly` in its categories. So I added it, as its common for TUIs to have it.\n\n#### Example:\n- [btop](https://github.com/aristocratos/btop/blob/main/btop.desktop#L16)\n- [yazi](https://github.com/sxyazi/yazi/blob/main/assets/yazi.desktop#L10)\n\n## Solution\nAdd `ConsoleOnly` to `Categories`\n\nThanks!",
